# Nocturna gallery image store — Phase 5 bot commit target.
#
# The Discord photo bot (nocturna-bot repo) commits web-ready images here as
# `public/gallery/<file>` alongside entries in `src/data/gallery.json`
# (schema: { file, caption?, width, height, date }). GitHub Pages serves these
# files as-is — no Astro import wiring, format-agnostic (WebP/JPEG).
#
# This .gitkeep keeps the empty directory in git so the site builds with zero
# photos. Do NOT delete — the bot writes real images next to it.
